### Inscription d'un utilisateur
POST http://localhost:3000/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstname": "John",
  "lastname": "Doe",
  "email": "john.doe2@example.com",
  "password": "qwerty123"
}

### Connexion réussie
POST http://localhost:3000/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john.doe2@example.com",
  "password": "qwerty123"
}


### 1. Se connecter pour obtenir le token
POST http://localhost:3000/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john.doe2@example.com",
  "password": "qwerty123"
}

### 2. Ajouter un cours avec le header Authorization
POST http://localhost:3000/courses
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic am9obi5kb2UyQGV4YW1wbGUuY29tOnF3ZXJ0eTEyMw==

{
  "title": "Introduction to NodeJS",
  "nbChapters": 10
}

### Créer un cours via la route protégée /courses/new
POST http://localhost:3000/courses/new
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic am9obi5kb2VAZXhhbXBsZS5jb206cXdlcnR5MTIz

{
    "title": "Introduction to NodeJS",
    "nbChapters": 10
}

### Test erreur nbChapters manquant
POST http://localhost:3000/courses/new
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic am9obi5kb2VAZXhhbXBsZS5jb206cXdlcnR5MTIz

{
    "title": "Introduction to NodeJS"
}